[{"id":452,"name":"AlphaRAR.martingale_assignMart","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.YDK2026.Assignment","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"79eed6be35d50dbc","local":"23d1f945a0e918b8","content":"4234ebeeb5276379"},"doc":"**The assignment process is a martingale**.\nFor an adapted, integrable assignment indicator `X`, the martingale part `M` of the count process\nis a martingale for the previous-history filtration `ℱ.shiftDown`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m0","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"μ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"ℱ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Filtration ℕ m0"},{"explicit":false,"name":"X","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsFiniteMeasure μ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hX","role":"hypothesis","type":"MeasureTheory.StronglyAdapted ℱ X"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hX_int","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (n : ℕ), MeasureTheory.Integrable (X n) μ"}],"conclusion":"MeasureTheory.Martingale (assignMart X ℱ μ) ℱ.shiftDown μ","decl":"AlphaRAR.martingale_assignMart"},"code":"/-- **The assignment process is a martingale**.\nFor an adapted, integrable assignment indicator `X`, the martingale part `M` of the count process\nis a martingale for the previous-history filtration `ℱ.shiftDown`. -/\n@[specifies assignMart \"names the filtration the martingale property actually holds for: \\\n`ℱ.shiftDown`, not `ℱ`. Against `ℱ` itself the compensated count is *not* a martingale, so this \\\nis the fact that justifies the whole `shiftDown` detour\"]\nlemma martingale_assignMart [IsFiniteMeasure μ]\n    (hX : StronglyAdapted ℱ X) (hX_int : ∀ n, Integrable (X n) μ) :\n    Martingale (assignMart X ℱ μ) ℱ.shiftDown μ","proof":":=\n  martingale_martingalePart (stronglyAdapted_count hX) (integrable_count hX_int)","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/YDK2026/Assignment.lean","start":58,"end":67,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/YDK2026/Assignment.lean#L58-L67"},"deps":[22,455],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommMonoid","mathlib","class"],["Bot.bot","mathlib","definition"],["BoundedOrder.toOrderBot","mathlib","instance"],["CompleteLattice.toBoundedOrder","mathlib","instance"],["CompleteLattice.toLattice","mathlib","instance"],["Finset.range","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.sum","mathlib","definition"],["InnerProductSpace.toNormedSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Lattice.toSemilatticeSup","mathlib","instance"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.instCompleteLattice","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration.mk","mathlib","constructor"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration.seq","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.Integrable","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.IsFiniteMeasure","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.Martingale","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.StronglyAdapted","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.martingalePart","mathlib","definition"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.casesOn","lean4","definition"],["Nat.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Nat.succ","lean4","constructor"],["NonUnitalSeminormedCommRing.toNonUnitalSeminormedRing","mathlib","instance"],["NonUnitalSeminormedRing.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedCommRing.toSeminormedCommRing","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["OrderBot.toBot","mathlib","instance"],["PartialOrder.toPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Pi.addCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Preorder.toLE","mathlib","instance"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["RCLike.toInnerProductSpaceReal","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instRCLike","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedCommRing","mathlib","instance"],["Real.pseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["SemilatticeSup.toPartialOrder","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddGroup.toContinuousENorm","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedCommRing.toNonUnitalSeminormedCommRing","mathlib","instance"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Unit","lean4","definition"],["Unit.unit","lean4","definition"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[{"comment":"names the filtration the martingale property actually holds for: `ℱ.shiftDown`, not `ℱ`. Against `ℱ` itself the compensated count is *not* a martingale, so this is the fact that justifies the whole `shiftDown` detour","target":"AlphaRAR.assignMart"}],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"9c97c6b035ac350efe572511d115065fe2785be5","date":"2026-09-01"}},{"id":453,"name":"AlphaRAR.assignMart_succ_sub","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.YDK2026.Assignment","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"24533d4d10d82b05","local":"1114a6204a34b248","content":"eae85776fd45da1a"},"doc":"The increment of the assignment martingale is `X n - μ[X n | ℱ (n-1)]`, i.e. `ΔM = X - p`\nfor the selection probability `p_n = μ[X n | ℱ (n-1)]`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m0","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"μ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"ℱ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Filtration ℕ m0"},{"explicit":false,"name":"X","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"n","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"}],"conclusion":"assignMart X ℱ μ (n + 1) - assignMart X ℱ μ n = X n - μ[X n | ↑ℱ.shiftDown n]","decl":"AlphaRAR.assignMart_succ_sub"},"code":"/-- The increment of the assignment martingale is `X n - μ[X n | ℱ (n-1)]`, i.e. `ΔM = X - p`\nfor the selection probability `p_n = μ[X n | ℱ (n-1)]`. -/\n@[specifies assignMart \"identifies the compensator as the selection probability \\\n`p_n = μ[X n | ℱ_{n-1}]` — conditioning on the history *strictly before* patient `n`, which is \\\nwhat makes `p_n` the probability of assigning arm `k` to that patient\"]\nlemma assignMart_succ_sub (n : ℕ) :\n    assignMart X ℱ μ (n + 1) - assignMart X ℱ μ n = X n - μ[X n | ℱ.shiftDown n]","proof":":= by\n  have hg : count X (n + 1) - count X n = X n := by rw [count_succ]; abel\n  unfold assignMart martingalePart\n  rw [predictablePart_add_one, hg, count_succ]\n  abel","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/YDK2026/Assignment.lean","start":69,"end":79,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/YDK2026/Assignment.lean#L69-L79"},"deps":[22,455],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommMonoid","mathlib","class"],["Bot.bot","mathlib","definition"],["BoundedOrder.toOrderBot","mathlib","instance"],["CompleteLattice.toBoundedOrder","mathlib","instance"],["CompleteLattice.toLattice","mathlib","instance"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["Finset.range","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.sum","mathlib","definition"],["HAdd.hAdd","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["InnerProductSpace.toNormedSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Lattice.toSemilatticeSup","mathlib","instance"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.instCompleteLattice","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration.mk","mathlib","constructor"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration.seq","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.condExp","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.martingalePart","mathlib","definition"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.casesOn","lean4","definition"],["Nat.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Nat.succ","lean4","constructor"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["OrderBot.toBot","mathlib","instance"],["PartialOrder.toPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Pi.addCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Pi.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Preorder.toLE","mathlib","instance"],["RCLike.toInnerProductSpaceReal","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instRCLike","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["SemilatticeSup.toPartialOrder","mathlib","instance"],["Unit","lean4","definition"],["Unit.unit","lean4","definition"],["instAddNat","lean4","instance"],["instHAdd","lean4","instance"],["instHSub","lean4","instance"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[{"comment":"identifies the compensator as the selection probability `p_n = μ[X n | ℱ_{n-1}]` — conditioning on the history *strictly before* patient `n`, which is what makes `p_n` the probability of assigning arm `k` to that patient","target":"AlphaRAR.assignMart"}],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"9c97c6b035ac350efe572511d115065fe2785be5","date":"2026-09-01"}},{"id":454,"name":"AlphaRAR.abs_assignMart_succ_sub_le","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.YDK2026.Assignment","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"82811566873d6bd9","local":"cc11c8341503f36e","content":"690b8b58d65205fd"},"doc":"The increments of the assignment martingale are bounded by `1`: if `0 ≤ X ≤ 1` a.e., then\n`|M (n+1) - M n| ≤ 1` a.e. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m0","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"μ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω"},{"explicit":false,"name":"ℱ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Filtration ℕ m0"},{"explicit":false,"name":"X","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"MeasureTheory.IsFiniteMeasure μ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hX_int","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (n : ℕ), MeasureTheory.Integrable (X n) μ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h0","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (n : ℕ), 0 ≤ᵐ[μ] X n"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h1","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (n : ℕ), X n ≤ᵐ[μ] fun x => 1"},{"explicit":true,"name":"n","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"}],"conclusion":"∀ᵐ (ω : Ω) ∂μ, |(assignMart X ℱ μ (n + 1) - assignMart X ℱ μ n) ω| ≤ 1","decl":"AlphaRAR.abs_assignMart_succ_sub_le"},"code":"/-- The increments of the assignment martingale are bounded by `1`: if `0 ≤ X ≤ 1` a.e., then\n`|M (n+1) - M n| ≤ 1` a.e. -/\nlemma abs_assignMart_succ_sub_le [IsFiniteMeasure μ]\n    (hX_int : ∀ n, Integrable (X n) μ)\n    (h0 : ∀ n, 0 ≤ᵐ[μ] X n) (h1 : ∀ n, X n ≤ᵐ[μ] fun _ ↦ (1 : ℝ)) (n : ℕ) :\n    ∀ᵐ ω ∂μ, |(assignMart X ℱ μ (n + 1) - assignMart X ℱ μ n) ω| ≤ 1","proof":":= by\n  have hc0 : (0 : Ω → ℝ) ≤ᵐ[μ] μ[X n | ℱ.shiftDown n] := by\n    have h := condExp_mono (m := ℱ.shiftDown n) (integrable_zero Ω ℝ μ) (hX_int n) (h0 n)\n    rwa [condExp_zero] at h\n  have hc1 : μ[X n | ℱ.shiftDown n] ≤ᵐ[μ] fun _ ↦ (1 : ℝ) := by\n    have h := condExp_mono (m := ℱ.shiftDown n) (hX_int n) (integrable_const (1 : ℝ)) (h1 n)\n    rwa [condExp_const (ℱ.shiftDown.le n)] at h\n  filter_upwards [h0 n, h1 n, hc0, hc1] with ω hx0 hx1 hcω0 hcω1\n  have e := congrFun (assignMart_succ_sub (X := X) (ℱ := ℱ) (μ := μ) n) ω\n  simp only [Pi.sub_apply, Pi.zero_apply] at hx0 hx1 hcω0 hcω1 e ⊢\n  rw [e, abs_le]\n  constructor <;> linarith","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/YDK2026/Assignment.lean","start":81,"end":97,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/YDK2026/Assignment.lean#L81-L97"},"deps":[455],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommMonoid","mathlib","class"],["Bot.bot","mathlib","definition"],["BoundedOrder.toOrderBot","mathlib","instance"],["CompleteLattice.toBoundedOrder","mathlib","instance"],["CompleteLattice.toLattice","mathlib","instance"],["Filter.Eventually","mathlib","definition"],["Filter.EventuallyLE","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.range","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.sum","mathlib","definition"],["HAdd.hAdd","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["InnerProductSpace.toNormedSpace","mathlib","instance"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Lattice.toSemilatticeSup","mathlib","instance"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.instCompleteLattice","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration.mk","mathlib","constructor"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration.seq","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.Integrable","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.IsFiniteMeasure","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.instFunLike","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.instOuterMeasureClass","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.ae","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.martingalePart","mathlib","definition"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.casesOn","lean4","definition"],["Nat.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Nat.succ","lean4","constructor"],["NonUnitalSeminormedCommRing.toNonUnitalSeminormedRing","mathlib","instance"],["NonUnitalSeminormedRing.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedCommRing.toSeminormedCommRing","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["One.toOfNat1","lean4","instance"],["OrderBot.toBot","mathlib","instance"],["PartialOrder.toPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Pi.addCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Pi.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Pi.instZero","mathlib","instance"],["Preorder.toLE","mathlib","instance"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["RCLike.toInnerProductSpaceReal","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instOne","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instRCLike","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instZero","mathlib","instance"],["Real.lattice","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedCommRing","mathlib","instance"],["Real.pseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["SemilatticeSup.toPartialOrder","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddGroup.toContinuousENorm","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedCommRing.toNonUnitalSeminormedCommRing","mathlib","instance"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Unit","lean4","definition"],["Unit.unit","lean4","definition"],["Zero.toOfNat0","lean4","instance"],["abs","mathlib","definition"],["instAddNat","lean4","instance"],["instHAdd","lean4","instance"],["instHSub","lean4","instance"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"9c97c6b035ac350efe572511d115065fe2785be5","date":"2026-09-01"}},{"id":455,"name":"AlphaRAR.assignMart","kind":"Definition","keyword":"def","module":"AlphaRAR.YDK2026.Assignment","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":false,"hashes":{"meaning":"f87e185e56876a25","local":"4eea7165ffd46dd6","content":"fe02ad4fcb7340ad"},"doc":"The assignment martingale, i.e. the martingale part of the count process `N` in its Doob\ndecomposition with respect to the previous-history filtration `ℱ.shiftDown`. Its increments are\n`X n - μ[X n | ℱ (n-1)]`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m0","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace Ω"},{"explicit":true,"name":"X","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → ℝ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"ℱ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Filtration ℕ m0"},{"explicit":true,"name":"μ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure Ω"},{"explicit":true,"name":"","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"","role":"variable","type":"Ω"}],"conclusion":"ℝ","decl":"AlphaRAR.assignMart","value":"MeasureTheory.martingalePart (count X) ℱ.shiftDown μ a✝¹ a✝"},"code":"/-- The assignment martingale, i.e. the martingale part of the count process `N` in its Doob\ndecomposition with respect to the previous-history filtration `ℱ.shiftDown`. Its increments are\n`X n - μ[X n | ℱ (n-1)]`. -/\nnoncomputable def assignMart (X : ℕ → Ω → ℝ) (ℱ : Filtration ℕ m0) (μ : Measure Ω) : ℕ → Ω → ℝ :=\n  martingalePart (count X) ℱ.shiftDown μ","proof":"","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/YDK2026/Assignment.lean","start":52,"end":56,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/YDK2026/Assignment.lean#L52-L56"},"deps":[22,475],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommMonoid","mathlib","class"],["Bot.bot","mathlib","definition"],["BoundedOrder.toOrderBot","mathlib","instance"],["CompleteLattice.toBoundedOrder","mathlib","instance"],["CompleteLattice.toLattice","mathlib","instance"],["Finset.range","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.sum","mathlib","definition"],["InnerProductSpace.toNormedSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Lattice.toSemilatticeSup","mathlib","instance"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.instCompleteLattice","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Filtration","mathlib","struc